  "prefLabel": "Ncr 841.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 841.02 Scope. These rules shall only apply to OHRV clubs, political subdivisions, and snowmobile clubs as defined by Ncr 842.01 (l), (m), and (o).\n\nSource. #14293, eff 6-25-25, EXPIRES: 6-25-35",
